{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"南非","country_iso":"ZAF","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:47:16.387790","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"ZAF-XX-0001","ldc":"No","location":"北开普敦省","location_norm":"北开普省","name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"南非红石100兆瓦塔式光热电站项目","project_name_en":"South Africa Redstone 100MW CSP Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"山东三建","content":"近日，山东电建三公司EPC总承包的南非红石100兆瓦塔式光热电站项目紧抓施工黄金期，加快施工生产进度，迎来多个重要节点。\n8月14日，项目热熔盐罐保温及护板施工顺利完成。8月17日，项目ACC空冷岛系统DCS受电一次成功。8月18日，项目热灌保温施工所有脚手架拆除完成，热灌保温工作完成标志着项目部又一重要里程碑节点顺利实现。\n南非红石100兆瓦塔式光热电站项目位于北开普敦省，具有丰富的光照资源。项目采用塔式光热技术，其定日镜采用小镜面结构，镜面总面积超过百万平方米。项目计划投运后将预计每年能够向电网输送约480GWh电力，为南非20多万户家庭提供稳定电力供应。\n以光为媒，催生绿色未来。光热发电凭借零消耗、零排放、零污染和长寿命周期的优势，已成为以清洁和绿色方式满足世界电力需求的必然选择。山东电建三公司依托丰富工程业绩和精良核心技术，以智聚力、精研业务、优质履约，在全球光热市场占有率名列前茅，已逐步发展成为“一带一路”建设和能源合作的排头兵，全球清洁低碳能源的引领者。","content_sha256":"a9517ca2d021464baa6e323d84cba6b52dc1bb756a388b637d7aa52d74781879","id":12369,"publish_date":"2023-08-22 12:23:50","title":"南非最大塔式光热电站项目迎来多个重要节点","title_sha256":"a488e6e6fade838d98f3959de08a4af50588db9eb9631e15a2faccb3d53e38f2","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/45419.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"ZAF-XX-0001","capacity_details":"CSP: 100MW","capacity_mw":100.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"100","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:47:16.388830","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"ZAF-XX-0001-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.powerchina-intl.com/show/9/4246.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"Unknown","project_developer_en":null,"project_stage":"在建","project_summary":"中国山东电建三公司在南非承建了红石100兆瓦塔式光热电站项目。该项目位于北开普敦省，采用塔式光热技术，预计年输送电力约480GWh。目前项目已完成热熔盐罐保温及护板施工、ACC空冷岛系统DCS受电一次成功等多个重要节点。","publish_date":"2023-08-22 12:23:50","pv_capacity_mw":null,"source_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/45419.html\"]","storage_energy_mwh":null,"storage_power_mw":null,"total_investment_usd":null,"total_investment_usd_raw":"","transmission_capacity_mw":null,"verification_confidence":null,"verification_sources":null,"verification_status":"unverified","voltage_kv":null}}],"evidence_policy":{"exact_quote_required":true,"quote_must_not_cross_surfaces":true,"valid_surfaces":["title","body"]},"project_id":"ZAF-XX-0001","schema_version":"storage-taxonomy-evidence-package-v1","selection_reasons":["active_hybrid_category"]}
